      "hash": "29f217d5d86062d687fceaed0f8ff7da2900d2b2b33d409e4abfd6ebe310c1b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a838fa6b588c603c820b2931e936545a76992c8456ba741853abde8a8bce448",
      "text": "Primary source",
      "hash": "a518c683cac9ab4d00390db41fe8a1fb150258d23d103dec32e0017ff94a0b5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f35bf8e688f25f6b4ba15c84edc78cd57aee1cc9d05a2f5b92ec392f4b233b76",
      "text": "The thing itself — code, transcripts, raw data. Complete and authoritative, but expensive to load into context.",
      "hash": "1c7b05f219ea3b3f1d9ebf4ec8d1b1767dedd0ba7cdefb7d72ed7f538ae8ef58"
    },
    {
      "id": "77bfd6751a71a04958cb5dbb62b6bae3faa9a1c59f4851d6dac68e6f6e142337",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d19d57b7e65981d11de183c8ca89038301c2baa02e93133a90c93c4bc92eed8",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "2de028dcaa1e9102a8e8a589043b3ab61be09020f787e7447f8d80b3259b8012",
      "text": "A source of truth in its original form — the code, the conversation transcript, the raw log, the actual API response. Not an account of the thing; the thing. Counterpart to",
      "hash": "518215eae3106dca4526a14910d94b956fbbe6628c6b74a6f8d52a30c6656fa0"
    },
    {
      "id": "597b933f1fcf806550975e0983062b7de692c89bbbc7b4b1335fd6c5c7b3ed20",
      "text": "secondary source",
      "hash": "130ab3f910dec4f94436851c6b9a50abec9e6cb96e7aadf7c47be2e57da1c894"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae2e6b84d317008d547e4dd40a473e81702361cd2730d7e922ece863b61b0f5a",
      "text": "If you want to know what your codebase does, the code is the primary source. The docs, the architecture diagram, and the README are all descriptions of it — accurate when written, on their own schedule ever since. When an",
      "hash": "6bb79b3c92b1206b1a14a10be302ffc1b20eff9006ba8e8b51cb158dcfb54a03"
    },
    {
      "id": "43f53b7582b12258916708144dfc389d1acf2e2e419001dd49de73bd8a30dee3",
      "text": "confidently asserts something wrong about your project, the question to ask is which source it was working from: an agent that read a doc inherits the doc's staleness; an agent that read the code is reading the current truth.",
      "hash": "46bf6d9ece8eb4f3aac10d1ed2c90242dd5025e976e082930832c33289ebfd51"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d586505c756a2668bf597546f2d2ffd4e6734e2785813faf5916065766c3975",
      "text": "The cost is what keeps primary sources from being the default. Loading one into the",
      "hash": "848c5bc375e15f7fe7f02cdb2cdcadd8dc39a9cfd6b2b1f2715daba48060b957"
    },
    {
      "id": "50eb29756736d8a9d3439b4af2e3d9fe5966e380052f7bb3089e0d04417ed54b",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a3b44a00d6262025193f35e8b4b9f8fc1513059aa90caeae7d4a41919ba6789",
      "text": "is expensive — the full file, the full transcript, every",
      "hash": "6a22ee51a779b5daa2815af05c7221f4c60724591c663a53354d340ef2bc8625"
    },
    {
      "id": "e331e4869a132c2c67ad0a5c2aa94385e96999dfa9d1fa500ef2039b086f060b",
      "text": "billed as",
      "hash": "3aee4c1f0ab9a97639e64d534322cf21ef705a499bbbcaa5bca4936ca63a76b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e54c5557d2c43443b608fa83ad82fef6c09dd0434213c808a0c652d44b500bf",
      "text": "and competing for",
      "hash": "c7d58538ae74d97c2e8dd05a175773f4d8ffc4b1c4212a62116628891df1b004"
    },
    {
      "id": "6683e74881632aead1fcb6a7ca3c64296d68af625d41e7e638a14ceb4a2e290b",
      "text": "attention budget",
      "hash": "4f0ecd6ea97f18771cbd4203a929018449d8dbd4c6cce6f90fd7511b5c34cc81"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e0b4133a9d40165337d8a8f1e1b095ae7b0c5da91cfaa98f2a67e4b929e7206",
      "text": ". What you get for the cost is completeness: nothing has been pre-filtered by someone else's judgement about what mattered. A summary written last month can't contain the detail that turned out to matter today; the primary source still does.",
      "hash": "a201600677c66268a699ff79cefa30c65c7ff4110bd696b563c6852e20fea09b"
    },
    {
      "id": "8414023d6710636d4ab417c6359969a22dd282a3e77d5a608e1391872d80518b",
      "text": "Reach for the primary source when precision matters — the exact signature, the actual error, the line that throws. Much of managing",
      "hash": "3c24561d94d78ec340ce772e3dcb6093ce3b366ca0b473c731cbf836303d6fbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "4bf57d22a7c0363eb4f812df0dba0c74cf8df8d07085c6fc773732674ce0e35b",
      "text": "is deciding when to pay for the primary source and when a secondary source is good enough.",
      "hash": "292fd52546613a67920f8edbb345cbcce01e356c208e4a8131aa45b2067785d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea94673f287b5cd97f5424a215e1d037b1617d880669cb56e177c7541a125a8d",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8e2eb18ba0bd5df82ea974e5013b0a171b16839656803cf7799d3906f772727",
      "text": "\"The agent says the retry logic backs off exponentially, but I'm watching it hammer the endpoint.\"",
      "hash": "0d54d83adc8155e75c324ac7c47a1e9f48c3dece21323921036dfd0893d657fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc3f5e7a5804bffc8c1db1d54fb00bbe2021af513444628285e0bdb38adb4150",
      "text": "\"It read that out of the design doc. Point it at the actual retry module — work from the primary source when the behaviour matters.\"",
      "hash": "8fae8dedf77725eee885117923e50da943ba721af286210235e5be5d304227a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "64aaa201c832d34ed62c9ac91e9b9764de4235407de515a70c433d91ac86f81a",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc1a7a423c91820fbf11830e1ff25dbfd358c2b4dcbf18fe80b3bfa3e00364d4",
      "text": "Handoff",
      "hash": "f89e2d72da00888b27c938fff1eff1d138fd49fb664d0269527a69e746ced479"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ceca9b5a831bc1c6aad9cd7018ea2b3ce701ecfecfd9e2dbf55eae11343f4b7",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc464f3522cfeee50a4a09c939573030e5439ab9abcd2b2419af45b0cfaadf1e",
      "text": "Secondary source",
      "hash": "bfb4e03af539fffd1e5f2d37e16646bad9d6d8ed76c5e690a4111372b24e93df"
    },
    {
      "id": "56886297106eb71f9a3c3fc3cbafea61b17946edfda7ec911e6daf2db3ab7f67",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
